    "body": "This commit prevents the propagation of an error due to rustc not being found, which can mess up e.g. syntax highlighting via treesitter.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-02T19:20:26Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "silently ignoring an error is not acceptable.\r\n\r\nif the user enables the config but the config just silently doesn't work, the user will be confused. what is your advice in that case?",
