        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "A vim.notify() will do. With my patch, as it is right now, it currently notifies the user that a workspace could not be found. Of course this is misleading when the actual problem is the absence of a rust installation.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"632\" height=\"102\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dde7abd7-0f98-43ad-88d6-f942b992487b\" />\r\n",
